.TH REGOLITH-DISPLAYD 1 "2026-08-09" "regolith-displayd 0.3.4" "User Commands"
.SH NAME
regolith-displayd \- display settings daemon for Regolith
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B regolith-displayd
.SH DESCRIPTION
.B regolith-displayd
provides D-Bus bindings for display configuration in the Regolith desktop.
It synchronizes display settings with the active Sway compositor and stores
display profiles through the configured
.B kanshi
integration.
.PP
The daemon is normally started by the packaged user service.  It does not
normally require command-line arguments.
.SH SEE ALSO
.BR kanshi (1)
